.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH imify-config-get 1 "" "imify" ""
.SH NAME
imify\-config\-get \- Print a setting\*(Aqs value and where it comes from: flag, env, config or default
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBimify config get\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-api\-url\fR] [\fB\-\-profile\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIKEY\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print a setting\*(Aqs value and where it comes from: flag, env, config or default
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Write JSON instead of text [env: IMIFY_OUTPUT=json]
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Write the result only
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Log more detail to stderr: \-v for debug, \-vv for trace
.TP
\fB\-\-yes\fR
Confirm without prompting
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-color\fR
Disable color [env: NO_COLOR]
.TP
\fB\-\-api\-url\fR \fI<URL>\fR
API host [env: IMIFY_API_URL] [default: profile, then https://platform.imify.ai]
.TP
\fB\-\-profile\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Settings profile in the config file [env: IMIFY_PROFILE] [default: default]
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fIKEY\fR>
The setting
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
api\-url: The API host every networked command talks to
.RE
.SH EXTRA
Example:
  imify config get api\-url
